<title>USA: Shelter Components Corp Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Shelter Components Corp Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>ELKHART, Ind. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.22		    $0.29</p>
<p> Net			  1,686		    2,268</p>
<p> Revs		     106,532		  119,796</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,752		    7,719</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago shares outstanding and per share earnings adjusted for five-for-four stock split in June 1996.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 results include earnings from operations of Danube Carpet Mills, which were sold on December 31, 1996. Excluding Danube, Q1 1996 revs were $102.0 million and net income was $1.69 million or $0.20 a share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
